Lyd Atomic Steam Deck
Base image: Bazzite Deck stable
Target hardware: Steam Deck LCD
Gaming session: Steam Gaming Mode (Gamescope)
Desktop session: Plasma Bigscreen (selected by Exit to Desktop)
Switch to Gamescope: Switch to Gamescope app in the Bigscreen launcher
Management: lydmanage, lydsetup, lydm, lydhelp and lydev
Theme: Mystical KDE theme, Plymouth and GRUB artwork
